# Ctrl+A inside a zoomed project selects its children, and gG groups them under the zoom title.
file <<END
Work:
	Q4:
		- Budget
		- Hiring
Home:
	- Paint
END
keys j .
see Q4:
keys <C-a> gG
type Admin
keys <Esc>
see ▌   Admin
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	Q4:
		Admin
			- Budget
			- Hiring
Home:
	- Paint
END
